<title>UK: London shipsales - Feb 3.</title>
<headline>London shipsales - Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Ascona - (built 1981) 64,942 dwt sold for $9.5 million.</p>
<p>Otterpool - (built 1982) 64,664 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $9.5 million &quot;as is&quot; with drydock due.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Trans Borg - (built 1980) 5,380 dwt sold to Norwegian buyers for $8 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8071</p>
</text>
